# Runtime configuration / 运行配置
# Copy to .env once; keep real credentials in .env only.
# 首次使用复制为 .env；已有 .env 请直接编辑，勿覆盖密钥。
# Priority: process environment > .env > this file.
# Lists accept JSON arrays or comma-separated values; maps use JSON.
# Relative data paths use the working directory; classifier path uses the project root.
# Empty API_BASE_URL means same origin. Empty index-file paths follow INDEX_DIR.
# Prompt values can span lines inside quotes. Restart after changing configuration.

# Server and browser / 服务与前端
